<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίρροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσόρροπος</span>
			, <i>counterpoising, compensating for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγειν . . λύπης ἀ.
			ἄχθος</span> to balance the <i>counterpoising</i> weight of
			sorrow, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				120
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θεανοῖ . . ἀ.</span>
			<i>balancing</i> her, <i>weighing as much as . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				26.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτῆμα πόνοις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
				</span></i>
			 Tyr.<i><span class="en">
				6.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥώμη πρὸς κίνδυνον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Def.</u>
					412a
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιρρόπως, πράττειν τινί</span>
			<i>so as to balance</i> his power, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.1.36
			</span></i>: also neut. pl. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὰς δ᾽ ἀντίρροπα θέντες</span>”
				<i>as a counterpoise,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					1.442
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίζυγος</span>
			, <i>equivalent to,</i> c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				3.15
			</span></i>.</div>
